rm performance.</p><p><br></p><p>Ideal for ISPs, telecom providers, and enterprise fiber networks in Bangladesh, this splitter is perfect for connecting two subscribers or creating a small-scale branch in your fiber network.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><p><br></p><ul><li><b>Split Ratio:</b> 1×2 for equal optical power distribution</li><li><b>Wavelength Range:</b> 1260–1650 nm (compatible with EPON, GPON, and CATV)</li><li><b>Low Insertion Loss:</b> ≤ 3.5 dB typical</li><li><b>High Uniformity:</b> ≤ 1.0 dB</li><li><b>Durable Packaging:</b> Mini Module, ABS Box, LGX Box</li><li><b>Connector Options:</b> SC/UPC, SC/APC, LC/UPC, LC/APC, or bare fiber</li><li><b>Certified Reliability:</b> Telcordia GR-1209 &amp; GR-1221</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"ZTI 1×4 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%974-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"180৳","old":"200৳","single":""},{"name":"ZTI 1×16 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%9716-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"","old":"","single":"450৳"},{"name":"ZTI 1×8 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%978-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"","old":"","single":"210৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/zti-1%C3%9716-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/1%C3%9716%20PLC/ZTI%201%C3%978%20PLC%20Fiber%20Optic%20Splitter%20P1-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"ZTI 1×16 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","width":100,"height":100},"name":"ZTI 1×16 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","now":"","old":"","single":"450৳","tax":"Ex Tax:450৳","out":false},{"href":"/zti-1%C3%974-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/products_2025/ZTI-1%C3%974-PLC-Fiber-Optic-Splitter-100x100.jpg.webp","al